  "totalBlocks": 86,
  "translatedBlocks": 86,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80f921dc9023261e",
      "translationZh": "人工智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1121d6a96a88ab7b",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon OpenSearch Service MCP Apps 实现智能体式可观测性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b2f8e554a385f52",
      "translationZh": "可观测性智能体的速度很快。它们查询告警，将日志与追踪关联起来，并在几分钟内提出根因假设。仍然耗时的环节是验证。你阅读智能体的文字摘要，在浏览器中打开可观测性工具，导航到追踪瀑布图，查看服务地图以确定影响范围，再将智能体告诉你的内容与你在屏幕上看到的内容交叉核对。智能体为你节省了查询时间，却没有为你节省切换标签页、迁移上下文和手动验证的时间。这些仍然是你的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b43dffccd504a5b9",
      "translationZh": "Amazon OpenSearch Service MCP Apps 弥补了这一差距。MCP Apps 扩展了模型上下文协议，让每次工具调用的响应都包含一个交互式可视化组件——追踪瀑布图、服务拓扑图或日志模式视图——并将其与文字响应一起，直接呈现在 AI 助手的聊天窗口中。你让智能体展开调查，智能体便查询 Amazon OpenSearch Service。返回的响应既包含文字解释，也包含相关的仪表板组件。你可以在提出问题的同一对话线程中进行验证，无需打开单独的浏览器标签页，也无需重新运行查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aeb72ec9cc4dc478",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将解释 MCP Apps 如何改变你的可观测性工作流程，并逐步介绍设置过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7062d90e0f5f237c",
      "translationZh": "问题：验证仍然需要离开智能体交互循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9fe99363f736dc0",
      "translationZh": "典型的调查循环如下。首先，工程师向智能体提问，获得一个以文字形式呈现的根因假设。接着，他们离开 IDE，打开浏览器，并登录一个独立的可观测性界面。然后，他们在另一个工具中手动重新运行查询，以复现智能体的发现。将智能体的文字输出与实际仪表板进行对比，完成可视化验证后，他们再回到智能体，继续对话，但此时已经丢失了调查进度的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0521b0cefd441eec",
      "translationZh": "智能体几秒钟就能生成响应，但你必须离开智能体的环境才能进行验证。这意味着要登录一个独立的可观测性环境，并手动浏览仪表板。这种外部验证循环就是瓶颈。它迫使你承担在工具之间切换的工作，削弱了智能体自动化的速度优势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e1b536f872a453a",
      "translationZh": "在本地运行智能体式可观测性系统的组织，选择了控制权和成本效率，而非供应商提供的 AI。但从历史上看，这一选择始终伴随着取舍：与将 AI 和自身服务紧密耦合的供应商托管解决方案相比，本地智能体式配置牺牲了易用性，有时也牺牲了智能体性能。对于这些团队而言，验证鸿沟是主要的运维负担。他们针对自主性进行了优化，但验证仍然在独立的可观测性工具中，以人工速度进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cfc495fd0d86d876",
      "translationZh": "解决方案：MCP Apps 将可观测性 UI 引入你的 IDE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44368fba192a68ac",
      "translationZh": "Amazon OpenSearch Service 现已支持 MCP Apps，这项功能通过双重响应模式扩展了 MCP。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc2490799e188e32",
      "translationZh": "当你的 AI 智能体调用 MCP App 工具时，响应包含两个部分。第一部分是文本摘要，其中包含简洁的结构化数据。第二部分是在同一对话线程中渲染的交互式可视化，供你审查。OpenSearch MCP App 通过对驱动仪表板的相同数据源执行代码来生成可视化。因此，结果是确定性的。你无需信任 AI 的解读，而是可以看到实际查询结果以交互式图表、追踪瀑布图或服务拓扑图的形式呈现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45c98d3f2abc3d18",
      "translationZh": "图 1：MCP App 在智能体式 IDE 内渲染可观测性报告，展示按服务统计的错误数量，以及 AI 生成的根因分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ad344868dc58dfd",
      "translationZh": "MCP Apps 功能由本地 MCP 服务器、你的 IDE 和你的 OpenSearch UI 应用协同实现。本节介绍其架构、协议扩展机制，以及单次工具调用的端到端流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f7501dd6853af98",
      "translationZh": "本地 MCP 服务器在你的机器上运行。它充当智能体式 IDE 与 OpenSearch UI 应用之间的安全桥梁。该服务器提供可供 AI 智能体调用的可观测性工具。每次工具调用都通过 MCP 服务器发送到你的 OpenSearch UI 端点，执行查询，并将双重响应返回给你的 IDE。OpenSearch UI 是用于统一可观测性的无服务器界面，可与 OpenSearch 域、无服务器集合、CloudWatch 和 Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus 配合使用（了解更多关于 OpenSearch UI 的信息）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c8d2684437004be",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了请求流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f211139e7b2d0bb",
      "translationZh": "你始终拥有完全的控制权。MCP 服务器在本地运行。你的数据保留在你的 AWS 账户中。凭证、策略和域都由你掌控。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ba88b1102c5d4b1",
      "translationZh": "MCP Apps 如何扩展 MCP 协议",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b457a0e5b7d6f01",
      "translationZh": "标准的 MCP 工具调用返回纯文本响应。智能体发送一个 JSON-RPC 请求，指定工具名称和参数，服务器则返回文本结果，供智能体纳入其推理过程。MCP Apps 通过添加第二个响应通道来扩展这一模式：一个可视化载荷，由 IDE 渲染为交互式组件，与文本一同显示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc1a9c1f29813e6e",
      "translationZh": "当本地 MCP 服务器收到工具调用时，它会使用你配置的 AWS 凭证进行身份验证，并以 HTTP API 调用的形式将请求转发到你的 OpenSearch UI 应用程序端点。OpenSearch UI 针对你已连接的数据源执行查询，并返回结构化的文本摘要和已渲染的可视化产物。支持的数据源包括 OpenSearch 域、无服务器集合以及 Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus。MCP 服务器将这些内容封装为单个 MCP 响应，其中包含供智能体使用的文本内容，以及供 IDE 宿主渲染的可视化内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa158ac3b6408e9b",
      "translationZh": "IDE 宿主检测到可视化载荷后，会将其渲染为对话线程中的交互式组件。OpenSearch MCP App 在服务器端针对你的实际数据执行代码，生成可视化。因此，渲染输出具有确定性，与你在 OpenSearch 仪表板中看到的内容一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "96b31dbaea4f4cac",
      "translationZh": "一次工具调用的端到端流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ef9f0d10a8c1f8a",
      "translationZh": "为了说明双响应模式在实践中的运作方式，我们以一次链路追踪调查为例。以下分步说明展示了当你的智能体调用链路追踪调查 MCP App 工具时会发生什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c78160532aad964",
      "translationZh": "智能体发送的内容。你的智能体向链路追踪调查 MCP App 发起工具调用，传入链路追踪 ID 或服务名称和时间范围等筛选条件作为参数。该调用通过标准 MCP 协议从你的 IDE 传输到本地 MCP 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8f295db9eefe2fc",
      "translationZh": "服务器如何执行调用。本地 MCP 服务器接收工具调用，使用你的 AWS 凭证进行身份验证，并将请求转发到你的 OpenSearch UI 应用程序端点。OpenSearch UI 对你连接的数据源执行追踪查询，检索匹配的跨度，并组装响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbf867dd9fdf6159",
      "translationZh": "双重响应包含什么。MCP 服务器在单个响应中返回两种输出。文本部分包含结构化摘要，其中包括追踪 ID、总持续时间、跨度数量、关键路径，以及对故障起源位置的分析。可视化部分包含交互式追踪瀑布图，以 MCP App 的形式在你的 IDE 中呈现，展示跨度层级、时间信息和错误注释。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c2d0da16acfef6c",
      "translationZh": "智能体与人类分别如何使用响应。你的智能体从文本摘要中提取上下文，用于下一步推理，例如将发生故障的跨度与相关日志条目关联起来。与此同时，你可以在同一个对话线程中看到交互式追踪瀑布图。你可以展开各个跨度、检查属性，并通过可视化方式确认根本原因，无须打开单独的浏览器标签页。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a14b4a88af87650",
      "translationZh": "MCP Apps 支持贯穿整个生命周期的可观测性调查，其工具可在各个调查阶段之间串联使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f3be948fb0008217",
      "translationZh": "核心调查工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2916cc1af85cfb6",
      "translationZh": "典型的调查始于分诊与响应工具，这些工具会展示当前活跃的告警、关联各个数据源中的相关告警，并按严重程度展示分类明细，以便你的智能体确定问题的处理优先级。智能体识别出受影响的服务后，日志调查工具会搜索错误模式，并将相似的日志条目聚类，以分离出故障特征。随后，追踪调查工具会定位具体的分布式追踪，展示跨度层级和延迟明细，并精确指出故障的起源位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5644cc090048f91f",
      "translationZh": "上下文与可视化工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbc9502b1c846a33",
      "translationZh": "为了量化影响，指标调查工具会执行 PromQL 查询并进行阈值分析，而服务性能工具则提供服务级别的 RED 指标（速率、错误、持续时间）。拓扑工具将服务地图呈现为依赖关系图。该图展示各条边上的调用量和错误率，以便你确定影响范围。在整个调查过程中，动态可视化工具会根据你指定的查询生成折线图、柱状图、面积图和指标图，而数据集与关联工具则支持跨信号连接和数据摘要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65c15cfd44c06084",
      "translationZh": "专用工具用于满足新兴需求。AI 和智能体可观测性工具可追踪大型语言模型（LLM）调用，并为构建自有 AI 工作流的团队呈现智能体追踪图。技术栈健康状况工具可报告集群状态和分片分配情况。埋点评分工具可检测遥测数据质量方面的缺口，帮助团队改善可观测性覆盖范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baf3bcd59525c349",
      "translationZh": "图 2：追踪调查 MCP App，在 IDE 内显示跨度层级结构、时间线和故障源头分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "481c746d702e8439",
      "translationZh": "重新审视值班场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d464b2af84de5409",
      "translationZh": "有了 MCP Apps，同样的值班调查现在变成了这样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b6b41644d870658",
      "translationZh": "工程师向智能体提问：“是什么导致结账错误激增？”智能体通过查询日志、关联追踪数据以及检查服务地图来展开调查。随后返回一份双重响应，其中既有文本摘要，也有在同一对话线程中呈现的交互式可视化内容（告警视图、追踪瀑布图和服务地图）。工程师无需离开 IDE，即可在对话中滚动浏览 MCP App 可视化内容，并选择跨度详情来确认影响范围。最后，工程师指示智能体起草问题摘要或触发修复操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29ba52ea1e5e2639",
      "translationZh": "工程师始终无需离开 IDE。调查、验证和解决问题都在同一个对话线程中完成。对于值班工程师来说，这意味着更快地解决问题，以及更直接的 AI 智能体协作体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a88a1198b6d993f",
      "translationZh": "图 3：服务地图 MCP App，显示依赖关系图，以颜色编码表示错误率，以连线宽度表示调用量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d60a381beea93f6d",
      "translationZh": "入门：设置 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de682a12ab003e24",
      "translationZh": "按照以下步骤，将你的智能体式 IDE 连接到你的 OpenSearch UI 应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cf4babb0f99e500",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确认你具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e34cb73cddf7e255",
      "translationZh": "一个 OpenSearch UI 应用程序，其中的可观测性工作区已连接到至少一个数据源（Amazon OpenSearch Service 域、无服务器集合或 Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe78eb19e2a66964",
      "translationZh": "一个兼容的智能体式 IDE（Claude Desktop、VS Code GitHub Copilot、Goose、ChatGPT 或 Cursor）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "afe9dd4fedf99370",
      "translationZh": "本地已安装 Node.js 22 或更高版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66d781b7b1a14e43",
      "translationZh": "已配置具有 es:ESHttpGet 和 es:ESHttpPost 权限的 AWS 凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34ab27402ec8af4e",
      "translationZh": "以下流程将逐步介绍如何下载服务器、配置你的 IDE 并验证连接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04ed3d51beb3e70f",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：下载并解压 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c86fed78a1d6d63",
      "translationZh": "下载并准备 MCP 服务器软件包：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc116f4d21c47139",
      "translationZh": "前往 OpenSearch 可观测性 MCP 服务器下载页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee4e5e661fa640ca",
      "translationZh": "下载 MCP 服务器的 .zip 文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f298fcb860639715",
      "translationZh": "解压该压缩包。解压后的目录包含一个 server/server.js 文件。记下此文件的完整路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab458af069916423",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：将 MCP 服务器添加到你的 IDE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa44431858b986a0",
      "translationZh": "每个受支持的 IDE 都有一个 MCP 配置文件。以下列表说明了在哪里可以找到它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33d01c9fa6e96ee4",
      "translationZh": "Claude Desktop：设置 → 开发者 → 编辑配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c1202e71ea74e37e",
      "translationZh": "VS Code GitHub Copilot：工作区中的 .vscode/mcp.json，或用户设置 → MCP 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93b390ce0e07b2da",
      "translationZh": "Cursor：设置 → MCP → 添加服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19d4a999bd97a603",
      "translationZh": "Goose：~/.config/goose/mcp.json（通过扩展）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "707f2f0f7870edf0",
      "translationZh": "ChatGPT：设置 → MCP 插件 → 添加。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6739b2a75796b66d",
      "translationZh": "打开你的 IDE 配置并添加以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a2bc700d96f7117",
      "translationZh": "将占位值替换为你的 OpenSearch UI 端点、AWS 区域和配置文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "080ad89bafcedbdb",
      "translationZh": "要查找你的 OpenSearch UI 端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1edd32b212ecc92d",
      "translationZh": "打开 Amazon OpenSearch Service 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "508827086b2aa5ee",
      "translationZh": "在导航窗格中，选择“应用程序”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3b0271502ab986a",
      "translationZh": "选择你的 OpenSearch UI 应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00fe88041388321d",
      "translationZh": "复制应用程序 URL（例如，application-abc123.us-west-2.opensearch.amazonaws.com）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d73090ee2bdb630",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：验证连接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d48a7729d919f4c2",
      "translationZh": "保存配置后，重启你的 IDE 或重新加载 MCP 服务器列表。然后在 IDE 中输入以下提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce1cf6f641d19cb2",
      "translationZh": "“列出可用的可观测性数据源”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bd26e957028acb8",
      "translationZh": "如果智能体返回你已连接的数据源（Amazon OpenSearch Service 域、无服务器集合或 Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus 工作区），则说明 MCP 服务器已正确配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c0158bedce5274e",
      "translationZh": "如果收到错误，请检查你的 AWS 凭证是否有效，以及你的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 策略是否包含针对你的 OpenSearch UI 应用程序 ARN 的 es:ESHttpGet 和 es:ESHttpPost 操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90922cc42f35a801",
      "translationZh": "提示：要在不使用生产数据的情况下进行测试，请部署 OpenTelemetry Demo 应用程序，以在你的 Amazon OpenSearch Service 域中生成示例追踪、日志和指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f758e942130ee50e",
      "translationZh": "要移除 MCP 服务器配置，请打开 IDE 的 MCP 设置，并删除 opensearch-observability-stack-mcp 条目。然后，从本地计算机中删除解压后的 MCP 服务器目录。此设置不会创建任何云资源，因此无需在 AWS 端进行清理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67d09b6bcda741bc",
      "translationZh": "下表总结了 MCP Apps 如何改变值班工作流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e85c2a101fe4028c",
      "translationZh": "智能体返回文本 → 打开浏览器 → 登录 → 导航 → 手动验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80b5a98b706a4db4",
      "translationZh": "智能体返回文本 + 交互式可视化 → 在对话内直接查看",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccf8b213bd972b57",
      "translationZh": "你无法在 AI 输出中看到底层数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d567f4282ecf66fd",
      "translationZh": "MCP App 的结果是确定性的（OpenSearch MCP App 会执行代码）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f97520b070460948",
      "translationZh": "在 IDE 和仪表板标签页之间切换上下文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "360637c13bc09bea",
      "translationZh": "在 IDE 中使用单一对话线程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcacf29c30aac220",
      "translationZh": "智能体仅基于自身输出进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4da7f91524b20994",
      "translationZh": "智能体将 MCP App 的结果作为额外的结构化上下文读取",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ac94f1eeafaae49",
      "translationZh": "人工验证需要跨外部平台进行，耗时数分钟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06d0cc94e4642182",
      "translationZh": "验证时间缩短至数秒，并在智能体交互中直接完成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed3fe1e124725fd6",
      "translationZh": "借助 MCP Apps，Amazon OpenSearch Service 弥合了智能体可观测性中的验证缺口。你的 AI 智能体开展调查，交互式证据则在同一对话线程中呈现：无需切换上下文，无需单独登录，也无需重新运行查询。对于值班工程师而言，这可能意味着更快地解决问题。对于在本地运行智能体可观测性的组织而言，这提供了你所期望的运维简便性，同时不牺牲准确性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccd0b2524c53fe16",
      "translationZh": "立即开始：有关设置说明，请参阅 Amazon OpenSearch Service 开发者指南中的《使用 MCP Apps 实现智能体可观测性》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
